+        {
+          "id": "step-2-1",
+          "claim": "Apply step 1.1 to $\\mathcal U$. This gives a locally finite open cover $\\{W_s\\}_{s\\in S}$ and assigned $U_s\\in\\mathcal U$ such that $\\overline{W_s}\\subseteq U_s$. [step 1.1]",
