+          "id": "step-1-1",
+          "claim": "For each member of $\\mathcal U$, take all ambient open $O$ whose trace $O\\cap A$ is that member; together with $X\\setminus A$, these ambient open sets form an open cover $\\mathcal W$ of $X$. [F1, construct]",
+          "step": "1.1",
+          "inputs": [
+            "F1",
+            "construct"
+          ]
+        },
+        {
+          "id": "step-1-2",
+          "claim": "By [F2], fix a locally finite open cover $\\mathcal V$ refining $\\mathcal W$. [F2, choose]",
