+          "claim": "The $W_n$ cover $X$: if $n$ is the least index with $x\\in U_n$, then $x\\notin\\overline{V_i}$ for $i<n$, since $\\overline{V_i}\\subseteq U_i$, and hence $x\\in W_n$. [step 1.1, step 2.1, step 3.1]",
