+{"id":"fs-paracompactness-is-hereditary","statement":"ai-altered","proof":"ai-generated","evidence":"semantic-source","urls":["https://webhome.auburn.edu/~gruengf/papers/Topology_Course_Notes.pdf","https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0166864121000869"],"rationale":"The sources identify omega_1 as nonparacompact and the standard inclusion omega_1 in omega_1+1 as the open-in-compact obstruction to hereditary paracompactness. The item makes Choice explicit and packages the standard witness as a refutation with a local derivation.","alpha_concurred":false,"at":"2026-08-09"}
