+          "quote": "For any family $(X_i)_{i\\in I}$, if every $X_i$ is $T_0$, respectively $T_1$, respectively Hausdorff, then $\\prod_{i\\in I}X_i$ is respectively $T_0$, $T_1$, respectively Hausdorff. The empty product is included.",
