+- Proposed facts:
+
+  `[L1] The space is regular ([[lem-paracompact-hausdorff-is-regular]]).`
+
+  `[L3] In a regular space, x∈O open gives an open R with x∈R⊆cl(R)⊆O ([[lem-regularity-via-closed-neighbourhoods]], implication (a)⇒(b)).`
