+- `lem-regular-lindelof-spaces-are-paracompact` — proof `ai-altered`.
+- `fs-paracompact-spaces-are-normal` — proof `ai-generated`.
+- `fs-paracompactness-is-hereditary` — proof `ai-generated`.
